    <briefdescription>
<para>A single chained node in the hash table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The node header is followed immediately in the same allocation by a copy-constructed V value. Access via _node_value() / _node_value_c(). The key is stored as a separately allocated copy of sizeof(K) bytes. </para>
